&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: white&quot;&gt;David。和你愚蠢的傻样完全不符合的帝王的名字。. A regal name unfit for your crass stupidity.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: white&quot;&gt;Pat on the back. Kudos. Thinking those silent screams inside your chest that won&#039;t stop refusing to stop fearing a dead man&#039;s slapping flesh. Consuming everything behind your already-hollow eyes. Emptying your brains for more prying room. We&#039;re coming through the rotten gaps in your brittle teeth.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: white&quot;&gt;Remembering you David? They&#039;re hardly thinking about you. Noising inside until you&#039;re not thinking about you either. Go ahead.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
